<h2><span data-i18n="review.common.overview">Overview</span></h2>
<p>Butterfly iQ is revolutionizing medical imaging with the world's first handheld, whole-body ultrasound device powered by AI. Unlike traditional ultrasound machines that cost tens of thousands of dollars and require dedicated rooms, Butterfly iQ is a pocket-sized probe that connects to your smartphone or tablet, delivering clinical-grade imaging at a fraction of the cost. Since its FDA clearance in 2018, over 100,000 clinicians worldwide have adopted Butterfly iQ for point-of-care diagnostics.</p>
<p>The device uses proprietary semiconductor technology instead of traditional piezoelectric crystals, enabling a single probe to perform all ultrasound examinations from cardiac to musculoskeletal imaging. AI-powered features provide real-time guidance for probe positioning, automated measurements, and image optimization, making ultrasound accessible to healthcare providers regardless of experience level. Cloud integration allows instant sharing with colleagues and specialists for collaborative diagnosis.</p>
<p>Butterfly iQ is transforming healthcare delivery in emergency departments, primary care clinics, rural hospitals, and global health settings where traditional ultrasound machines are impractical or unaffordable. With HIPAA-compliant cloud storage, telemedicine integration, and continuous AI improvements, Butterfly iQ represents the future of democratized medical imaging.</p>
<h2><span data-i18n="review.common.key.features">Key Features</span></h2>
<div class="features-grid">
<div class="feature-card"><div class="feature-card-icon"><svg class="neon-icon" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewbox="0 0 24 24"><rect height="20" rx="2" ry="2" width="14" x="5" y="2"></rect><line x1="12" x2="12.01" y1="18" y2="18"></line></svg></div><h4>Handheld Ultrasound Device</h4><p>Pocket-sized probe connects to smartphones and tablets for whole-body imaging anywhere. Single probe for all applications from cardiac to OB/GYN.</p></div>
<div class="feature-card"><div class="feature-card-icon"><svg class="neon-icon" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewbox="0 0 24 24"><rect height="10" rx="2" width="18" x="3" y="11"></rect><circle cx="8" cy="15" r="1"></circle><circle cx="16" cy="15" r="1"></circle><path d="M9 7L9 9M15 7L15 9M12 2v5"></path></svg></div><h4>AI Image Guidance</h4><p>Real-time AI assistance for probe positioning and image optimization. Auto-detects anatomy and suggests optimal imaging planes for accurate diagnostics.</p></div>
<div class="feature-card"><div class="feature-card-icon">📏</div><h4>Automated Measurements</h4><p>AI-powered automatic measurements for cardiac function, vessel diameter, and anatomical structures. Reduces measurement variability and saves time.</p></div>
<div class="feature-card"><div class="feature-card-icon"><svg class="neon-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M18 10h-1.26A8 8 0 1 0 9 20h9a5 5 0 0 0 0-10z"/></svg></div><h4>Cloud Storage Platform</h4><p>HIPAA-compliant cloud storage for unlimited studies. Access images from any device and build a searchable archive of all examinations.</p></div>
<div class="feature-card"><div class="feature-card-icon"><svg class="neon-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M10 13a5 5 0 0 0 7.54.54l3-3a5 5 0 0 0-7.07-7.07l-1.72 1.71"/><path d="M14 11a5 5 0 0 0-7.54-.54l-3 3a5 5 0 0 0 7.07 7.07l1.71-1.71"/></svg></div><h4>Telemedicine Integration</h4><p>Instant sharing of live or recorded studies with remote specialists. Enable real-time collaboration and expert consultation from anywhere.</p></div>
<div class="feature-card"><div class="feature-card-icon">📤</div><h4>Instant Image Sharing</h4><p>Share images and videos via secure links or integrate with EHR systems. Export DICOM files for seamless workflow integration.</p></div>
<div class="feature-card"><div class="feature-card-icon"><svg class="neon-icon" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewbox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M22 10v6M2 10l10-5 10 5-10 5z"></path><path d="M6 12v5c3 3 9 3 12 0v-5"></path></svg></div><h4>Built-in Training Modules</h4><p>Interactive educational content and scanning protocols within the app. Learn ultrasound techniques with step-by-step guidance and practice modes.</p></div>
<div class="feature-card"><div class="feature-card-icon"><svg class="neon-icon" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewbox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 11-5.93-9.14"></path><polyline points="22 4 12 14.01 9 11.01"></polyline></svg></div><h4>FDA Approved Device</h4><p>FDA 510(k) cleared for 13 clinical applications. Meets rigorous safety and efficacy standards for clinical diagnostic use in healthcare settings.</p></div>
</div>
<h2 id="pros-cons">Pros &amp; Cons</h2>
